    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in the opposing player's [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), right after an enemy unit finishes shooting or fighting.\n\nPick a **TYRANIDS CHARACTER** unit of yours that this enemy unit destroyed this phase; it is eligible although destroyed. For the rest of the battle, attacks by **GENESTEALER CULTS** models of yours against that enemy unit get +1 to [Hit rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) and +1 to [Wound rolls](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls).",
